    "name": "Alwadih Backend API",
    "description": "Comprehensive Postman collection for the Alwadih API including Multilingual (ar/en) support, User & Admin Authentication (with 2FA OTP), Password Reset flows, Support Requests, User Preferences, User Profile management, Public Content (FAQ & Privacy Policy), and Admin-only Parts CRUD.",
